    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0e0c16c9483124133bc8052",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我，是那种追求多样性的类型！　没法决定\n跑哪边！　而且要当全能跑者！　而且――",
      "source_fingerprint": "80584d5cc29785b1fa7892d8d976c29f24710aa2ea2d10df257352689924e74d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
