    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce8c5832205557791bbda4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好，好啦，配合一下我讲话……！\n那种精神饱满的人很可怕啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "302bff748d1dd97cd97e5922461413ed236630fb0de24d6abf6ff96ebdc75704",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
