      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "马娘们奔跑的理由各不相同。但无论是何种形式，\n追逐梦想的身姿都是美好的。所以我自己要支持她――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c378b3d779244bfebfc6ec3c6d87f65b4f65c0934d39563015bc416c46919af7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
